## SSH / secrets plumbing

| Item | Source of truth | Local cache |
|------|-----------------|-------------|
| SSH hosts | Pass **SSH Host Config** | `~/.ssh/config.local` via chezmoi |
| Host keys | Pass **SSH Key — …** items | `~/.ssh/id_ed25519_*` via bootstrap |
| GitHub key path | Pass `SSH Key — github` | `~/.ssh/id_ed25519_github` |
| chezmoi.toml vault/item IDs | recreated from `pass-cli … list` | `~/.config/chezmoi/chezmoi.toml` |
| API keys for CLI | Pass logins (OpenRouter, …) | `~/.zshrc.local` via `pass-write-zshrc-local.sh` |

See **`docs/secrets-pass.md`**.

---

## Reinstall checklist (this machine)

1. Install Homebrew + clone `dotfiles-macos` (README or `ansible/`).
2. `pass-cli login` (GUI Terminal) → fill local `chezmoi.toml` (README Step 4).
3. `./scripts/bootstrap-secrets-from-pass.sh --agent-load --with-zshrc-local`
4. `ansible-playbook setup-macos.yml --limit <host> --tags brew,chezmoi` (if not covered above).
5. Parallels: method for **this** arch (table above).
6. AI **GUI** OAuth: re-login apps; CLI keys already in `~/.zshrc.local` from Pass.
7. Restore this `machine.md` from private backup (Pass note, encrypted disk, …).

